OL,3,GNEWSAThe #1k school bus and the
OL,4,Adecade-long fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a decade, there has been
OL,7,Fa debate over how children from one
OL,8,Frural primary school travel to the high
OL,9,Fschool most go on to attend.
OL,11,FIt has left some parents paying more
OL,12,Fthan #1,000 per year for a private bus.
OL,14,FBut with the local council now
OL,15,Freviewing its policy, could this
OL,16,Fchange?
OL,18,FBarnabas Oley Primary School, known
OL,19,Flocally as BOPS, serves the
OL,20,FCambridgeshire villages of Great and
OL,21,FLittle Grandsen, Abbotsley and
OL,22,FWaresley.
